    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.7760314941406,
        293.0414123535156,
        418.6570129394531
      ],
      "text": "This section deals with the following question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.57659912109375,
        492.8821716308594,
        444.66461181640625
      ],
      "text": "Are there implications for user preferences and values, equity, acceptability,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.9765930175781,
        500.8428955078125,
        459.0646057128906
      ],
      "text": "feasibility and human rights from the implementation of a concurrent testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.3766174316406,
        255.92176818847656,
        473.4646301269531
      ],
      "text": "approach (LC-aNAATs + LF-LAM)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.1316223144531,
        527.0264892578125,
        497.2766418457031
      ],
      "text": "The GDG assessed whether concurrent testing of multiple samples would increase the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.6316223144531,
        526.9634399414062,
        512.776611328125
      ],
      "text": "accuracy (i.e. the benefit to patients or the programme in terms of finding more people with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.131591796875,
        527.1075439453125,
        528.276611328125
      ],
      "text": "TB). Three PICO questions concerned the different concurrent sample combinations for specific",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975021362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.631591796875,
        526.8037719726562,
        543.776611328125
      ],
      "text": "groups facing challenges from reliance on respiratory samples alone (children and people living",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.961833953857422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.131591796875,
        526.9921264648438,
        559.276611328125
      ],
      "text": "with HIV). One question focused on the concurrent use of LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.631591796875,
        410.1444091796875,
        574.776611328125
      ],
      "text": "and LF-LAM on urine for the diagnosis of TB in people living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.6192626953125,
        226.36456298828125,
        600.7072143554688
      ],
      "text": "User preferences and values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.8741455078125,
        494.1719665527344,
        623.0191650390625
      ],
      "text": "As important outcomes of the diagnostic test, people in high TB burden settings value:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.6259765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        642.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        629.6259765625,
        527.1292724609375,
        642.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "getting an accurate diagnosis and reaching diagnostic closure (finally knowing “what is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        645.1259765625,
        171.57540893554688,
        658.27099609375
      ],
      "text": "wrong with me”);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.6259765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        673.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        660.6259765625,
        526.9630126953125,
        673.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "avoiding diagnostic delays, as they exacerbate existing financial hardships and emotional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        676.1259765625,
        524.4429931640625,
        689.27099609375
      ],
      "text": "and physical suffering and make people feel guilty for infecting others (especially children);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997349739074707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.6259765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        704.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        691.6259765625,
        236.3772735595703,
        704.77099609375
      ],
      "text": "having accessible facilities; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.1259765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        720.27099609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
